{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[],"persons":[{"id":"cuimao-p2-heshao","name":"何邵（何曾子）","evidence":["cuimao-q2-5b8507ff45f43068efeb"],"facts":[{"id":"cuimao-f2-50b6efc12241abedd898","text":"何邵为何曾子，字敬祖，嗣爵，位至太宰，谥康公。","evidence":["cuimao-q2-5b8507ff45f43068efeb"]}],"aliases":[],"mentions":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"cuimao-q2-5b8507ff45f43068efeb","section":"chapter-012","block":"b-095e777870ac7fb66998","layer":"pei","quote":"《晋诸公赞》曰：“曾以高雅称，加性纯孝，位至太宰，封朗陵县公。年八十余薨，谥曰元公。子邵嗣。邵字敬祖，才识深博，有经国体仪，位亦至太宰，谥康公。子蕤嗣。邵庶兄遵，字思祖，有干能；少经清职，终于太仆。遵子绥，字伯蔚，亦以干事称；永嘉中，为尚书，为司马越所杀。”","attribution":"裴注（引书见原文）","section_title":"崔毛徐何邢鲍司马传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0029.xhtml","index":257,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-62da5d107b0f07f7e09d","start":0,"end":129,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
